OL,3,GNEWSATesco shuts city store after
OL,4,Acomplaint about mice
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Tesco Express store in Birmingham
OL,7,Fcity centre has been shut for more than
OL,8,Fweek as a "precautionary measure" after
OL,9,F"evidence of mouse activity was
OL,10,Fidentified".
OL,12,FBirmingham City Council said an officer
OL,13,Fhad visited the Mailbox store on 9
OL,14,FOctober "following a complaint".
OL,16,FDespite no imminent risk being found to
OL,17,Fpublic health, a council spokesperson
OL,18,Fsaid: "Tesco chose to voluntarily close
OL,19,Fthe premises while it addressed the
OL,20,Fissues."
